<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Privacy Policy · MalucaApps</title>
<meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for MalucaApps mobile apps and games.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#171514">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<style>
  /* Sin fuentes ni recursos externos: la página no le pide nada a terceros. */
  :root {
    --bg: #f6f3ee;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --text: #221f1b;
    --muted: #6b645b;
    --line: #e7e0d5;
    --amber: #95661a;
    --amber-soft: #fbf0dc;
    --brand-bg: #171514;
    --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(34, 31, 27, .05), 0 8px 24px rgba(34, 31, 27, .06);
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #0f0e0d;
      --surface: #1a1816;
      --text: #ece7df;
      --muted: #a39b90;
      --line: #2c2925;
      --amber: #f0b048;
      --amber-soft: rgba(240, 176, 72, .12);
      --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, .3), 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, .25);
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font: 16px/1.65 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  a { color: var(--amber); text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  a:hover { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }

  /* cabecera de marca */
  .brand {
    background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%, rgba(240, 176, 72, .16), transparent 60%), var(--brand-bg);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 40px 20px 72px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .mark {
    width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 16px; display: block; margin: 0 auto 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, .45);
  }
  .wordmark { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .2px; }
  .wordmark span { color: #f0b048; }
  .brand h1 { margin: 18px 0 10px; font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 42px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.5px; }
  .updated {
    display: inline-block; margin: 0; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .08); color: #d9d2c7; font-size: 13.5px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .1);
  }

  main { max-width: 760px; margin: -48px auto 0; padding: 0 16px 48px; }

  /* resumen */
  .glance {
    display: grid; gap: 12px; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .tile {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 16px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .tile svg { width: 26px; height: 26px; color: var(--amber); display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .tile strong { display: block; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.35; }
  .tile small { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.45; margin-top: 3px; }

  .intro {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 20px 22px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .intro p { margin: 0; }

  /* índice */
  nav.toc { margin: 0 0 20px; }
  nav.toc ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  nav.toc a {
    display: inline-block; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text); background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav.toc a:hover { border-color: var(--amber); color: var(--amber); }

  /* secciones */
  section {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 22px 22px 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    scroll-margin-top: 16px;
  }
  section h2 {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;
    margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -.1px;
  }
  section h2 .n {
    flex: none; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 9px; display: grid; place-items: center; margin-top: -2px;
    background: var(--amber-soft); color: var(--amber); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;
  }
  section p, section ul { margin: 0 0 14px; }
  section ul { padding-left: 20px; }
  section li { margin-bottom: 6px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .path { font-weight: 600; font-size: .95em;
    background: var(--amber-soft); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 6px; white-space: nowrap; }

  .contact { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .button {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 12px;
    background: #f0b048; color: #1d1a16; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none;
  }
  .button:hover { filter: brightness(1.05); }
  .button svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }

  footer { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; padding: 8px 16px 40px; }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .brand { padding: 32px 16px 64px; }
    .glance { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
    .tile { padding: 14px; }
    section, .intro { padding-left: 18px; padding-right: 18px; }
    section h2 { font-size: 18px; }
  }
  @media print {
    .brand { background: none; color: #000; padding: 0 0 12px; }
    .wordmark span, .updated { color: #000; }
    main { margin-top: 0; }
    nav.toc, .glance { display: none; }
    section, .intro { box-shadow: none; break-inside: avoid; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="brand">
  <img class="mark" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="MalucaApps logo" width="64" height="64">
  <p class="wordmark">Maluca<span>apps</span></p>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: September 14, 2026</p>
</header>

<main>

  <div class="glance" aria-label="Summary">
    <div class="tile">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8.5-7 10-4-1.5-7-5.5-7-10V6l7-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      <strong>No personal information</strong>
      <small>We don't ask for your name, email or phone number.</small>
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="7" y="2" width="10" height="20" rx="2.5"/><path d="M11 18h2"/></svg>
      <strong>Progress stays on your device</strong>
      <small>Game progress and settings are not sent to us.</small>
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2.5"/><path d="M7 15l2.5-6L12 15M8 13h3M15 9v6h1.5a2 2 0 002-2v-2a2 2 0 00-2-2H15z"/></svg>
      <strong>Ads by Google AdMob</strong>
      <small>Google and its partners handle ad data.</small>
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h10M4 12h7M4 17h6"/><circle cx="17" cy="15" r="4"/><path d="M15.5 15l1 1 2-2"/></svg>
      <strong>You choose in Europe</strong>
      <small>EEA, UK and Switzerland: consent before personalized ads.</small>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="intro">
    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how MalucaApps ("we", "our") handles information when you use our mobile apps and games (the "apps"). By using our apps, you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.</p>
  </div>

  <nav class="toc" aria-label="Contents">
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#collect">Information we collect</a></li>
      <li><a href="#advertising">Advertising</a></li>
      <li><a href="#consent">Consent</a></li>
      <li><a href="#advertising-id">Advertising ID</a></li>
      <li><a href="#rights">Your rights</a></li>
      <li><a href="#children">Children</a></li>
      <li><a href="#third-party">Third-party services</a></li>
      <li><a href="#changes">Changes</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <section id="collect">
    <h2><span class="n">1</span>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>Our apps do not ask for or collect personally identifiable information such as your name, email address or phone number. In our games, progress and settings (for example, completed levels, sound and language) are saved only on your device and are not sent to us.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="advertising">
    <h2><span class="n">2</span>Advertising</h2>
    <p>Our apps show ads through Google AdMob. To show and measure ads, Google and its advertising partners may collect and process information such as your device's advertising ID, device model, operating system, IP address and approximate location. This information may be used to show personalized ads where you have allowed it or where the law permits it. Our apps may also use AdMob mediation, which allows other ad networks to serve ads; those networks process data under their own privacy policies.</p>
    <p>Learn more about how Google uses this data:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">How Google uses information from apps that use its services</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="consent">
    <h2><span class="n">3</span>Consent (European Economic Area, United Kingdom and Switzerland)</h2>
    <p>If you are in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom or Switzerland, the app asks for your consent before personalized ads are shown, using a consent form provided by Google. You can accept, reject or choose your options. You can change your choice at any time by clearing the app's data or reinstalling the app, and, where available, from the Privacy option in the app's settings.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="advertising-id">
    <h2><span class="n">4</span>Your Advertising ID</h2>
    <p>You can reset your advertising ID or opt out of personalized ads at any time in your device settings (on Android: <span class="path">Settings &gt; Google &gt; Ads</span>, or <span class="path">Settings &gt; Privacy &gt; Ads</span>, depending on your device).</p>
  </section>

  <section id="rights">
    <h2><span class="n">5</span>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on where you live (for example, under the GDPR in Europe or privacy laws in some U.S. states), you may have the right to access, correct or delete your personal data, and to object to or restrict its processing. We do not collect personal data ourselves; data used for advertising is handled by Google and its partners. If you have any request, contact us and we will help you.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="children">
    <h2><span class="n">6</span>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Our apps are designed for a general audience and do not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13. If you are a parent or guardian and believe that your child has provided personal information, please contact us and we will take the necessary steps to remove such information.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="third-party">
    <h2><span class="n">7</span>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>In addition to Google AdMob, our apps may contain links to third-party websites or services (such as Google Play or WhatsApp, when you share a result). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those third parties and encourage you to review their privacy policies.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="changes">
    <h2><span class="n">8</span>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top shows when it was last changed. Your continued use of the apps means you accept the updated policy.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2><span class="n">9</span>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
    <p class="contact">
      <a class="button" href="mailto:malucaapps@gmail.com">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2.5"/><path d="M4 7l8 6 8-6"/></svg>
        malucaapps@gmail.com
      </a>
    </p>
  </section>

</main>

